        "help_text": "Leave empty to use the banner image."
      },
      {
        "name": "body_copy",
        "label": "Scrolling text panel",
        "type": "richtext",
        "default": "<p>Technology companies are managing a set of tensions that don't resolve easily. Protecting market share while pursuing growth. Delivering reliability while staying ahead of what's coming next. Projecting stability without looking like yesterday's solution.</p><p>The leaders who navigate this most successfully are using those tensions to define what their category becomes next, to reimagine what their market looks like, and to build the kind of presence that makes competitors rewrite their playbooks. And doing all of it while demonstrating that marketing and communications efforts connect directly to revenue.</p><p>Highwire has spent decades working with technology companies navigating exactly these pressures. We know how to build the narrative that holds all of it together &mdash; without forcing a choice between who you are and where you're going.</p>"
      },
      {
        "name": "body_cta_label",
        "label": "Text panel CTA label",
        "type": "text",
        "default": "See our technology work"
      },
      {
        "name": "body_cta_url",
        "label": "Text panel CTA link",
        "type": "url",
        "supported_types": [
          "EXTERNAL",
          "CONTENT"
        ],
        "default": {
          "type": "EXTERNAL",
          "href": "/#work"
        }
      }
    ]
